ARMv7-A QEMU "virt" kernel.

    python3 util/arm/build_kernel.py
    sh util/arm/run_qemu.sh

The same core is intended for the SC8830 (goyave) tablet; see
ports/goyave for the board work.  This target is board-independent:
identity-mapped 1 MiB sections, PL011 console, GIC-400 and the ARM
generic timer.
